      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm gonna use this post to shamelessly plug another highly related request that might otherwise get ignored and buried (like 99% of canny): https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-an-option-to-disable-locomotion-animations-on-all-avatars",
