      "value": "I desperately need the ability to manually adjust the offset of my hands. I use Vive Wands and I'm gonna go out on a limb here and guess that the developers may not have tested the Wands with the new IK. On almost all my avatars my hands are not even close to where they are in the real world, the angle of the hand as well as the position on the controller is very off.",
